00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:50.580
like the dash cam viewer matter, but they can still be undermined by basic hardware limits,

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:58.160
as shown in another recent change. The Tesla Model YL wireless charger includes active cooling to

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:03.820
