delivery without those interruptions. Vertical integration allows Tesla to iterate on both the

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:21.540
charger hardware and the vehicle's thermal management software together. Future models could adopt

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:27.700
the cool approach as standard if it performs well. Hardware fixes like cooling also support longer

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:33.760
term manufacturing commitments elsewhere. The head of Giga Berlin stated that vehicle production at

