in the rankings. The result continues Tesla's strong position in one of Europe's most advanced electric

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:18.560
markets. Now, one thing worth watching is the gap between earlier Robotaxi promises and current

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:26.280
operational reality. Texas Robotaxi operations currently stand at just 42 vehicles despite earlier

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:32.560
broad deployment claims. The gap between announced timelines and actual fleet size continues to widen.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:38.460
Regulators and competitors are watching whether certification shortcuts translate into meaningful

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:44.800
scale. Taking a step back from today's headlines, the addition of active cooling to a wireless

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:51.580
charger for the Model YL quietly reframes how hardware limitations shape software-defined vehicle

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:58.100
experiences. Owners have long reported overheating during extended sessions with non-cooled units,

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:02.120
turning what should be a seamless feature into a recurring inconvenience.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:07.700
The engineering choice to add cooling suggests that even small physical constraints can limit the

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:13.680
perceived reliability of convenience technologies. Data from owner forums and early reports on the

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:18.720
non-cooled chargers show temperature-related throttling that extends charge times and reduces

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:25.040
