00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:30.480
those interruptions. This difference matters because wireless charging is positioned as a premium

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:36.640
convenience. Any friction here undercuts the value proposition relative to simpler plug-in alternatives.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:42.840
Tesla's vertical integration gives it a direct path to iterate on both the charger hardware

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:48.460
and the vehicle's thermal management software in tandem. By addressing the issue at the component

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:54.280
